These headers are bundled so that the window decorators can be built on
the system they run on, without a source tree. REVISION names the system
revision they are from; for any other revision, Themes' build-decorators.sh
fetches that revision's own headers.

renku/      Private headers of Renku OS (github.com/RenkuOS/Source), a fork
            of Haiku: app_server and interface kit headers, MIT licence
            (see the notices in each file), and the Anti-Grain Geometry
            headers (headers/libs/agg), under the licence in those files.

